  "title": "Bulgogi (Korean Barbecued Beef)",
  "description": "The flavorful marinade - made with soy sauce, sesame seeds and oil, garlic, and a little sugar - gives a unique flavor to beef and vegetables. Serve over white rice for a complete meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Paula Stotts"
  ],
